(1989c^2)(4a^4-4a^2b^2+b^4)-(a^2)(a^2+1989c^2-b^2)&=(2ab+28c^2)(a^2b^2+2a^2c^2+b^2c^2+a^2-b^2+4abc(2a+2b)+2c^2(a+2b)+b^2)\\
&= a^2(a^2+1989c^2-b^2)+(a^2+1989c^2)(4a^2b^2-4a^2b^2)-b^2(1989c^2-b^2)\\
&=a^2(a^2-b^2+1989c^2)+1989c^2(4a^2b^2-b^2)-b^2(1989c^2-b^2)\\
&=a^2(a^2-b^2+1989c^2)+(1989c^2)(4a^2b^2-b^2)-b^2(1989c^2-b^2)\\
&=(2a^2b+28c^2)(a^2b^2+4a^2c^2+4b^2c^2+4a^3bc+4ab^3c+c^4+a^4-b^4).
\end{align*}
But we also have the other side of the equation and we need to simplify that one in terms of $a$, $b$, and $c$ as well. The other side can be expressed in the following way.
